## For developers

Under the hood: libvips image processing via NetVips, AVIF/WebP/JPEG output with responsive `<picture>` elements and average-colour placeholders, Scriban templates, Markdown pages, Gzip/Brotli pre-compression and a NuGet-based plugin system. Extend it, script it in CI, or contribute: see the [developer orientation](docs/developer/).
